# Immutable Raw Sources

> **For future Claude**: This directory contains immutable raw source material. Claude reads from here but never writes to existing files. Each subdirectory contains a specific type of source.

## Subdirectories
- `articles/` - Clipped web articles
- `transcripts/` - Meeting notes, podcast transcripts
- `pdfs/` - PDF documents
- `videos/` - YouTube metadata and transcripts

## Rules
- Never modify files in this directory
- All files are verbatim captures
- Use `/obsidian-ingest` to process sources from here into the wiki
